go-secretstream — pure-Go libsodium crypto_secretstream_xchacha20poly1305

Wire-compatible with libsodium C (secretstream_xchacha20poly1305) and with
the framing used by WAL-G (8192-byte plaintext chunks, TAG_FINAL on last flush).

Derived work
------------
Reader/writer/crypter/key-transform surfaces were adapted from the WAL-G
libsodium crypter (Apache License 2.0), originally CGO-bound to libsodium.

